<wpt lat="44.967285" lon="-81.230603"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Parking area outside the Lion's Head Provincial Nature Reserve gate, accessible from…</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.968698" lon="-81.225886"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Ilse Hanel Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed Ilse Hanel Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.970031" lon="-81.220870"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.994910" lon="-81.197634"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Inland Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
